@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@accessToken = paste-the-token-from-login

### Login (supply local credentials; do not save real passwords or tokens in Git)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"login":"admin","password":"replace-locally"}

### Change the initial temporary password, then log in again
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/password
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"currentPassword":"replace-locally","newPassword":"replace-locally-with-new-password"}

### Current account (after changing the temporary password)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Logout revokes outstanding tokens
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
